  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">The respondent is engaged in the transportation of natural gas from the Texas Eastern/Adelphia interconnect in Bucks County, PA, Transco/Adelphia interconnect and Columbia Gas/Adelphia interconnect in Northampton County, PA in to delivery interconnects in Northampton County, PA, Delaware County, PA and New Castle County, DE.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
